ならステップ刻んで one, two, three
so I'll beat out the steps, 1, 2, 3.

461
00:29:28,226 --> 00:29:30,366
踊らされるんじゃない　踊るのよ
I'm not being manipulated, I'm dancing!

462
00:29:30,586 --> 00:29:33,766
さぁ　さぁ　さぁ　狂って
Yeah, I'm going crazy!

463
00:29:49,306 --> 00:29:51,326
暗い部屋　1人きり
In a dark room by myself,

464
00:29:51,326 --> 00:29:53,346
鏡の前　午前0時
before the mirror at midnight.

465
00:29:53,686 --> 00:29:55,806
「アナタ誰」「ワタシ誰」
"Who are you?" "Who am I?"

466
00:29:55,806 --> 00:29:58,366
問い掛けど返事は無かった
I asked, but received no reply.

467
00:29:58,366 --> 00:29:59,540
狂え
Go crazy.

468
00:30:00,466 --> 00:30:01,548
狂え
Go crazy!

469
00:30:01,886 --> 00:30:03,547
ほら見せてよ 新しいワタシを
Look at me now, the brand new me,

470
00:30:04,086 --> 00:30:05,826
ほら見てよ ほら触れてよ
Look at me now, touch me right now,

471
00:30:06,986 --> 00:30:09,026
透明な服で着飾って
Dressed up in transparent clothes,

472
00:30:09,186 --> 00:30:11,166
今サナギから 蝶になるの
Now from my chrysalis, I'll become a butterfly,

473
00:30:11,366 --> 00:30:13,186
ありのまま全て見せつけて
Showing off everything as it is,

474
00:30:13,386 --> 00:30:15,046
熱狂の舞台 演者はいない
On this impassioned stage, there are no performers,

475
00:30:15,186 --> 00:30:17,426
ならステップ刻んで one two three
So I'll beat out the steps, 1, 2, 3,

476
00:30:17,466 --> 00:30:20,046
踊らされるんじゃない 踊るのよ
I'm not being manipulated, I'm dancing!

477
00:30:20,186 --> 00:30:23,826
さあ さあ さあ 狂って 「異常」が胸を埋めつくして
Go crazy! "Abnormality" fills my chest,

478
00:30:24,026 --> 00:30:26,566
普通じゃない自分になるの
Becoming a me that isn't normal,

479
00:30:26,826 --> 00:30:30,206
歪んだ愛の成れの果て創られた 叶わぬ恋
An unfulfillable love born from warped love,

480
00:30:30,986 --> 00:30:35,026
「異常」が胸を埋めつくして 普通じゃない自分になるの
"Abnormality" fills my chest, becoming a me that isn't normal,

481
00:30:35,206 --> 00:30:41,646
自問自答繰り返し手に入れた 新しいワタシを
The brand new me I finally obtained after soul-searching.

482
00:30:51,394 --> 00:30:56,934
That wasn't a lullaby.

483
00:30:58,741 --> 00:31:02,481
If anything, everything was perfectly ready. It was started.
If anything, everything was already ready. It had started.

484
