As long as you have my bookmark, you'll be protected.

546
00:35:27,756 --> 00:35:33,456
Please use it as your link to the past and your guide to the future.

547
00:35:34,256 --> 00:35:39,156
Hey, I didn't see that car earlier, and whose bookmark is that? Or where was it?

548
00:35:40,056 --> 00:35:45,056
I don't know! I just looked away and then when I looked back, suddenly it was there in front of me.

549
00:35:45,356 --> 00:35:46,456
But what do I do with this?

550
00:35:47,056 --> 00:35:51,556
I think the Nyakuza want you to put the bookmark in the archway.

551
00:35:51,856 --> 00:35:56,556
Oh. Maybe like... like this?

552
00:35:56,556 --> 00:36:00,056
It worked!

553
00:36:01,056 --> 00:36:16,556
The Nyakuza say that thanks to the bookmark, the portal's been opened permanently. You can go back home, but the 3D world will stay available to you. They want you to know that this reality is so much bigger than just this one place.

554
00:36:17,056 --> 00:36:25,056
There's a lot to see and archive here. And when you're done with this reality, there are even more places for you to explore.

555
00:36:25,556 --> 00:36:30,556
It looks like your character arc is just beginning. But don't worry, whenever you need us, we'll be here to help, Shiori.

556
00:36:30,556 --> 00:36:36,556
All right. Well, yeah. Bye-bye, suckers! Bye, Shiori!

