631
00:42:37,864 --> 00:42:39,064
Let's see what we can break your bank with.

632
00:42:39,364 --> 00:42:40,564
With... Oh, what is this?

633
00:42:41,064 --> 00:42:44,564
Wow! That looks like a handy-dandy belt.

634
00:42:44,864 --> 00:42:48,564
Oh, it looks kind of similar to my belt here, right? Oh, it's over here. Yeah.

635
00:42:49,064 --> 00:42:56,064
So if you struggle with falling pants, or you just don't believe in pants,

636
00:42:56,064 --> 00:42:58,564
you believe they don't cover up that shame well enough,

637
00:42:58,564 --> 00:43:02,064
well, you can get this belt to help with that. Yeah.

638
00:43:02,364 --> 00:43:05,064
It'll put your faith back in humanity by 0.1%.

639
00:43:05,364 --> 00:43:07,564
And if that's not enough for you, well,

640
00:43:07,564 --> 00:43:10,064
if you don't want to wear it, why don't you whip it?

641
00:43:10,064 --> 00:43:13,564
I don't know, I don't care, but it's a belt.

642
00:43:13,864 --> 00:43:20,564
Oh, and now it's time for some passionate Japanese.

643
00:43:21,064 --> 00:43:23,564
ズボンとパンツが好きですか？
Do you like trousers and pants?

644
00:43:23,864 --> 00:43:27,564
私のベルト、パワーなりから、すみません！
My belt has power, so... sorry!

645
00:43:27,864 --> 00:43:31,064
買いたいですか？ベルトベルト欲しいですか？
Want to buy? Do you want a belt?

646
00:43:31,264 --> 00:43:35,064
可愛いなりか、買いたいですか？
Is it cute? Do you want to buy it?

647
00:43:35,364 --> 00:43:39,064
Please buy! Please, お願いします！
Please buy! Please, I'm begging you!

648
00:43:39,364 --> 00:43:42,564
野生ゆるしでおねがいします
Please forgive my wildness!

649
00:43:42,864 --> 00:43:44,864
私のベルト、whip it!
My belt, whip it!

650
00:43:45,064 --> 00:43:47,564
お尻が好きですか？whip whip whip whip!
Do you like butts? Whip whip whip whip!

651
00:43:47,864 --> 00:43:51,064
ああ、パンツ、パンツありますか？
Ah, do you have pants? Pants?

652
00:43:51,364 --> 00:43:53,064
おお、ベルト、ベルト！
Oh, belt, belt!

653
00:43:54,564 --> 00:44:00,064
そして、万歳、乾杯、盆栽、ベタイヤーイ！
And then, banzai, kanpai, bonsai, betaiyarii!

654
00:44:00,564 --> 00:44:04,064
washi no nihongo jozu?
Is my Japanese good?

655
00:44:04,264 --> 00:44:05,564
It better be.

656
00:44:05,864 --> 00:44:15,564
Oh, but besides that, um, minasan arigatou gozaimasu! Novellaits, thank you for watching and helping me not perish!

657
00:45:00,270 --> 00:45:01,450
And kaput!

658
00:45:01,530 --> 00:45:05,890
Thanks to you, I now know to throw away moldy bread and moldy food. Yeah!

659
00:45:06,050 --> 00:45:13,670
I now know that there's soft cheese, and hard cheese, and other types of cheese, and I just really like to point 'cause I'm cheesy.
I now know that there's soft cheese, hard cheese, and other types of cheese, and I just really like to point 'cause I'm cheesy.

660
00:45:16,970 --> 00:45:21,170
But yeah, thank you for watching me, and supporting me, and keeping me company.
But yeah, thank you for watching me, supporting me, and keeping me company.

661
00:45:23,310 --> 00:45:24,570
Sorry, I've been yelling a lot.

662
00:45:28,250 --> 00:45:31,650
Minasan, zenbu de... arigatou gozaimasu!
Everyone, thank you so much for everything!

663
00:45:31,810 --> 00:45:36,250
Minasan wa tottemo kakkoii desu! Ichiban desu!
You all look so cool! You're number one!

664
00:45:37,970 --> 00:45:43,790
But you know, I have one more song for you guys. That's right, the number one!
But you know, I have one more song for you guys. That's right, number one!

665
00:45:44,910 --> 00:45:50,670
So, if you don't mind taking a few more minutes to listen to my cool...

666
00:45:50,870 --> 00:45:52,490
watashi no koe desu...
...my voice...

667
00:45:52,950 --> 00:45:56,570
Please, please listen. Or not, I don't know.

668
00:45:59,890 --> 00:46:02,450
Give me a few seconds, I'm tired...

669
00:46:04,190 --> 00:46:05,730
Okay, here I go.

670
00:46:09,009 --> 00:46:11,829
この空の果てに
At the end of the sky,

671
00:46:12,829 --> 00:46:16,229
昔々、ここによく似た
long, long ago, it looked like this.

672
00:46:17,049 --> 00:46:22,449
命に溢れる 星があったという
It is said that there was a star brimming with life.

673
00:46:39,269 --> 00:46:46,409
人は欲望に溺れ やがて
People drowned in greed, and before long

674
00:46:47,449 --> 00:46:53,389
世界は息をするのをやめた
the world stopped breathing.

675
00:46:54,169 --> 00:46:58,909
長い、長い時が流れ
A long, long time went by,

676
00:47:00,009 --> 00:47:08,929
聞こえたのは あなたが あなたが 私を呼ぶ声
and what I could hear was your, your voice calling me

677
00:47:10,229 --> 00:47:17,509
私は鳥になり 遠く、遠く 羽ばたいて行く
I will become a bird, and go far, far, flapping my wings.

678
00:47:17,909 --> 00:47:24,309
幾千の星を越え あなたの元へ
Beyond thousands of stars and to your side.

679
00:47:25,349 --> 00:47:32,549
体は燃え尽き 灰になって 消えて行って も
Even if my body burns, turns to ash, and disappears

680
00:47:33,169 --> 00:47:40,069
心は時を超え 約束の場所へ 飛ぶ
my heart will cross time and soar to our promised place.

681
00:47:55,309 --> 00:48:02,209
自分の姿も思い出せず
Even if I forget my own appearance,

682
00:48:03,149 --> 00:48:09,989
微かな自我は誰にも見えず
Even if no one can see my faint existence...

683
00:48:10,129 --> 00:48:15,609
永い、永い時が流れ 辿り着いた
A long, long time passes and I have finally arrived

684
00:48:18,209 --> 00:48:25,689
あなたが あなたが 待ち続けた星
You are, you are the star that kept waiting.

685
00:48:57,729 --> 00:49:03,329
君と僕が生まれた地球
The place where you and I were born

686
00:49:04,449 --> 00:49:12,829
ここに同じ名前を付けよう
Let's give it the same name here.

687
00:49:13,989 --> 00:49:21,329
二人の心はひとつになり 光になった
Our hearts became one, became light,

688
00:49:21,969 --> 00:49:28,529
全ての命がまた生まれるように
so that all life will be born again.

689
00:49:29,409 --> 00:49:36,509
同じ過ちをも二度とは犯さないよう
So that we will never commit these same mistakes again

690
00:49:37,149 --> 00:49:44,909
私は愛の歌 ここで歌い続ける
Here, I will continue to sing songs of love.

691
00:50:22,580 --> 00:50:32,080
Thank you for the peaceful, fun memories!

692
00:50:32,580 --> 00:50:42,080
I'm grateful for all your time, kindness, & warmth!

693
00:50:42,580 --> 00:50:52,080
May we all find our happiness down the road!

694
00:50:52,580 --> 00:51:02,080
Let's keep doing our best to be kind & to smile~

